{
  "description": "Replacement of external timber door leading to garden due to significant levels of wood rot and prior alterations made to the door by the previous owner. For example a cat flap has been cut into the lower portion of the door, which is not in line with the original features of the door. \n\nA design has been produced by the door manufacturer to match the profile of the existing door, with two separate glass panes in the top half and a pannelled lower half of the door. \n\nThe door will be made using Accoya wood. We would also like to use double glazing for the glass panes. The existing door has single glazed glass panes.",
